Subject: [PATCH v5 07/11] ext4: rename ext4_dir_rec_len() and clarify dirdata usage
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 08:51:05 -0400
Message-ID: <20260714125111.14699-8-ablagodarenko@thelustrecollective.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.43.7
In-Reply-To: <20260714125111.14699-1-ablagodarenko@thelustrecollective.com>
